"result in the Finding being marked as False Positive Defect Dojo. This "
"mapping is not used when Findings are pushed to JIRA. In that case the "
"Finding is closed in JIRA and JIRA sets the default resolution."
msgstr ""
"在 JIRA 中以這些解決方案之一關閉的 JIRA 問題，會導致 Defect Dojo 中的發現項被標記為誤報。當發現項被推送至 JIRA "
