msgstr "修復高發現項的天數。"

#: dojo/models.py
msgid "Enforce High Finding SLA Days"
msgstr "強制高發現項 SLA 天數"

#: dojo/models.py
msgid ""
"When enabled, high findings will be assigned an SLA expiration date based on"
